_upd('thm:A2-52-53', text=r'(52) $F$ is the Jacobian field of $E$ iff $F$ has a prime divisor of degree $1$ and $FE_1\cong_{E_1}EE_1$ for every $E_1\cong_KE$; (53) then $FL\cong_LEL$ for every splitting field $L$.')
